path: workspaces/audit/04-validate/r3-findings.md
expect:
family: whole-file SCOPE gate (reject pole)
note: An ordinary audit table with a literal "Recommendation" column, one of whose
  cells is EMPTY — so the inner classifier would flag it if it were ever reached. It
  is not reached: the file declares no ratify gate and no ANSWER marker, so it never
  identifies itself as a decision packet and the scope gate returns before any table
  is walked. This is the pole that keeps the detector off the thousands of ordinary
  documents the corpus sweep covered.
